&lt;li&gt;Proven experience of consultancy within the General Insurance sector.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong track record delivering large-scale transformation programmes and complex change initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of insurance operations, including data governance, digital enablement, target operating model design, and an understanding of how AI can enhance business and technology transformation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management, influencing, and relationship-building skills, with the ability to support senior leaders in the responsible adoption of AI where appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of generating revenue within a consulting environment, while developing and managing senior client relationships, along with curiosity to explore approved AI tools and automation to improve delivery, productivity, and insight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting agile transformation initiatives and product ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of UK General Insurance regulatory change programmes, including awareness of AI governance and regulatory considerations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and implementing target operating models that incorporate AI-enabled capabilities where appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
